m-4658550-1846651706687410","game_id":"steam-4658550","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes - 10/18/2026","summary":"GameplayTurn signals are now easier to see during the daytimeTire and curb physics changes:When boosting: Rear tire grip is now greatly increased. Front tire grip is now increased, but to a lesser extent. Previously, front tire grip was unaffected while boosting.Stability at high speed is greatly increasedWhen driving on a curb during the \"Superwide\" upgrade:Tire grip is greatly increased. Sudden loss of traction should no longer occur when driving on a curb regardless of speed. When braking:Rem","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:44:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687410","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4658550-1846651706673080","game_id":"steam-4658550","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes - 10/13/26","summary":"GameplayAdded a visual indicator at the bottom of the screen to show, in real time, how many seconds it will take for the fracture to catch up to the player / how many seconds ahead the player is. The fracture sound is now plays based on time until catching up with the player instead of physical distance from the player. Increased number of lives up to 5 (from 3) Bug FixesFixed a bug that would cause the day and night cycle to continue during the upgrade selector screenFixed a bug that would cau","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T03:46:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4658550-1846018067935553","game_id":"steam-4658550","kind":"announcement","title":"NEW CONTENT / BUG FIXES - 10/10/26","summary":"Gameplay / Bug FixesTraffic:Now has turn signals. They turn on about 1 second before changing lanes. They turn off on completion or cancellation of the lane changeFixed a bug where traffic could sometimes get stuck between lanes or at awkward rotationsTractionImproved traction again. Downforce is now fixed regardless of angle, speed, etc. If traction is lost, it should no longer be unpredictable. Higher speeds can now be sustained quite well, even at odd angles, without fear of slipping. Fractur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T07:11:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935553","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4658550-1846018067928113","game_id":"steam-4658550","kind":"update","title":"The Terrain & Traffic Update","summary":"This is the biggest update to ALL GAS yet! Thanks to everybody who submitted feedback and suggestions during the playtest and demo! Many popular requests have been added, along with some surprises! Tons left on the roadmap....stay tuned!GameplayEnvironment, Scenery and TerrainComplete overhaul of the environment and scenery. Terrain is now generated alongside every track! More environments will be added soon.Day and night cycle is now on a timer instead of being coupled with the player's Z posit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T02:41:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4658550-1844751498229754","game_id":"steam-4658550","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes - 9/27/26","summary":"UI / UXAdded a countdown on the main page for the $175 Steam Gift Card tournament ongoing now in the demo!GameplayMoved the pass indicators up on the screen so that, in third person, they don't cover where the player is generally lookingSettingsAdded a way inside Settings to reset all controls to defaultChanged the default gamepad key for Switch Camera to Y / Triangle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T18:37:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4658550-1844751498229214","game_id":"steam-4658550","kind":"announcement","title":"ALL GAS DEMO TOURNAMENT","summary":"$175 PRIZE POOL, ONGOING NOW IN THE DEMO, LASTS 3 WEEKS, FREE TO ENTER, PLAY AT YOUR OWN PACE!All you need to do to enter this tournament is finish runs in the ALL GAS Demo on Steam. The players with the top 3 distances on the in-game global leaderboard as of 9:00 PM CDT on 10/18/2026 win a copy of ALL GAS when released, plus a Digital Steam Gift Card based on placement: 🥇1st - $100 🥈2nd - $50 🥉3rd - $25 Winners will be announced 10/19/2026 by 9:00 PM CDT. Cheaters will be disqualified. Full rul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T13:40:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229214","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4658550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4658550":"2026-10-26T03:18:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4658550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5217700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:1